Line Detection Combinatorial - License and Usage Notice
===========================================================

Copyright (c) Alexandre Matov. All rights reserved except as granted below.

1. Scope
--------
This repository contains Visual C++ 6.0 MFC source code (the `Button`
GUI project, the `Proba` DLL project, and the `bmp3` console project)
developed by Alexandre Matov for a graphical user interface to a fast
line-detection computer vision algorithm. This copyright notice covers
only that code -- see section 4 below for the `PLIME/` folder.

2. Permitted use
-----------------
Permission is granted to use, copy, and modify the code in this repository
