4. Third-party components
--------------------------
The `PLIME/` folder is third-party code -- the combinatorial
line/conic-detection engine by Marco Mattavelli, Vince Noel, and Edo
Amaldi (see the citation in README.md), including bundled third-party
X11 and Tcl/Tk headers and libraries. It is not covered by this notice;
it is included as-is for reference and is not modified in this
repository. Building `Button`, `Proba`, and `bmp3` requires Visual C++
6.0 / MFC -- see DEPENDENCIES.md.
